A collaboration event between [[Nyanko Daisensou]] and the role-playing game known as '''Monster Takt''' (モンスタータクト) was held from December 5th, 2013 to December 16th, 2013. The game is published by [https://www.siliconstudio.co.jp/en/ Silicon Studio].

