==Event==
*'''Collaboration Fixed Stages'''
Collaboration Stages are available to play via the Monster Takt app. There are twelve total stages, the first six being quest events, while the rest are raid events. Beating the first six will reward the player with a "Battle Cats Costume", along with some in-game currency.

